OL,3,GNEWSAMet Office issues weather warning 
OL,4,Afor rain                               
OL,6,FThe Met Office has warned that heavy   
OL,7,Frain could cause disruption in parts of
OL,8,FDevon and Cornwall, with flooding and  
OL,9,Ftravel delays possible.                
OL,11,FA band of rain is set to move across   
OL,12,Fthe two counties through Sunday, with  
OL,13,Fmore than 100mm (3in) of rain possible 
OL,14,Fover Dartmoor.                         
OL,16,FChief Met Office forecaster Matthew    
OL,17,FLehnert said: "This slow-moving band of
OL,18,Frain will gradually ease on Sunday     
OL,19,Fnight, but flooding and travel         
OL,20,Fdisruption is possible within the      
OL,21,Fwarning area."                         
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
