OL,3,GNEWSAMet Office issues weather warning 
OL,4,Afor rain                               
OL,6,FHe said there was still some           
OL,7,Funcertainty about where the heaviest   
OL,8,Frain would fall but southern areas of  
OL,9,Feach county were more likely to see    
OL,10,Fhigher rainfall.                       
